tools.description:
List workspace files, optionally using a bounded cursor page. Use
    session_artifacts, not this, for only the files executed code produced;
    use session_read_file for one file's contents.

Bind a TTS voice to a character asset — required before generate_voiceover
    for every character with dialogue (the narrator's voice is separate:
    set_narrator_voice). Browse ids with list_voices.

